00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:23.270
And as he guided us
through the maze of rocks,

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:27.760
and islands washed clean
of by the recent flood,

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.680
we moved through clumps of
bushes with branches there,

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.760
except for a very thin
line of foliage marking

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.830
the highest extent of the recent water.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.900
These are shrubs that would
ordinarily be submerged

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.910
during the wet season, then
exposed during the dry season,

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.310
leaf bear fruit and to be submerged again,

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.010
where the fish could come eat the fruits,

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.200
and then distribute the
seeds and things like this.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.590
But a rise fall of the river
in the space of a week,

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.000
as opposed to a year,

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.980
it gives very little
time for such processes.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.010
The buds are smothered,

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.370
before they even have a chance to grow,

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.773
