00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:52.620
The Mekong itself is in constant
motion in three directions.

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:54.230
It's flow is hypnotic.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.640
It normally flows from West
East until the monsoons

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.700
and (indistinct), and of
