00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:41.350
Now clear has come to take
a whole different meaning.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:43.860
At nights of the full moon,
those living on its banks

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:46.160
report fireballs erupting from its steps,

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.670
at which they attribute to Naga
is living within the river.

