So if you can all see, this
is the stretch of river

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:26.350
that I'm talking about there.

00:36:26.350 --> 00:36:29.560
You've got areas of the
bank that had been fortified

00:36:29.560 --> 00:36:30.393
by concrete.

00:36:30.393 --> 00:36:33.070
Over there is an island that I feature

00:36:33.070 --> 00:36:35.670
on the cover of the book,
but that tree is now gone.

00:36:41.450 --> 00:36:43.660
Anyway, that's looking across the border

00:36:43.660 --> 00:36:45.403
