00:44:25.710 --> 00:44:28.713
But in terms of what's
going on Lao certainly,

00:44:30.190 --> 00:44:31.720
the lack of stilts.

00:44:31.720 --> 00:44:35.910
And then efforts like
those rocks that you saw,

00:44:35.910 --> 00:44:39.340
