00:44:53.230 --> 00:44:55.680
because it's not really
able to deposit that,

00:44:55.680 --> 00:44:57.240
and so any silt that it has,

00:44:57.240 --> 00:45:00.470
gets jetted out into the sea,

00:45:00.470 --> 00:45:02.040
and doesn't really get deposited.

00:45:02.040 --> 00:45:04.880
So it's an entire change
in the way the river goes,

00:45:04.880 --> 00:45:08.720
and Vietnam being at the
very end of the system,

00:45:08.720 --> 00:45:12.650
gets a lot of the effects, a
lot of the downstream effects.

