00:48:31.950 --> 00:48:35.000
the time experience of the river,

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:40.000
and then how physical
transformation of the river

00:48:40.410 --> 00:48:42.840
is actually transforming the experience

00:48:42.840 --> 00:48:44.610
of time and temporality, right?

00:48:44.610 --> 00:48:48.880
So you talked about space,
on one hand obviously

00:48:48.880 --> 00:48:52.170
if you flood a river,
or you drain a river,

00:48:52.170 --> 00:48:55.000
the shape, and look, and
form of it will be different,

00:48:55.000 --> 00:48:58.250
and so it will change the
spatiality that people have to it,

00:48:58.250 --> 00:48:59.083
